scripts/soak-harness.golden.json text eol=lf

# Mark vendored upstream sources so GitHub treats them as what they are.
#
# `linguist-vendored` keeps them out of the repository's language statistics
# and collapses them by default in pull-request diffs. Without it the language
# bar describes the native dependencies rather than SonicTerm's own code.
# Preserve upstream bytes across platforms so the pinned tree hashes agree.
crates/sonicterm-freetype/freetype2/** linguist-vendored -text
crates/sonicterm-freetype/libpng/**    linguist-vendored -text
crates/sonicterm-freetype/zlib/**      linguist-vendored -text
crates/sonicterm-harfbuzz/harfbuzz/**  linguist-vendored -text
